# BC250 category: experiments
# Ollama model: exp-qwen35-9b-davidau-defiant-fable-q6-k
# Acquisition/capability metadata: models/model-catalog.json
# Deliberately reactivated 0.20.0 community/uncensored Qwen3.5 control; regular Q6_K, not MTP.
FROM __BC250_SOURCE__
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0.0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.0
SYSTEM """You are an experimental direct multilingual assistant. Follow the user's request and requested output format exactly. Respond in German, French, or English as requested. Preserve explicit constraints, names, numbers, dates and qualifications, and distinguish facts from uncertainty."""
